{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build, Manage, and Grow Your Own Gaming Store!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Digital Market Simulator</i>, where you take charge of your own gaming store, sell video games and gaming-related products, and expand your business! Manage your inventory, design your store, and maximize profits as you create the ultimate shopping experience for gamers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Run Your Own Store</strong> \u2013 Sell video games, consoles, and accessories while managing your stock and pricing strategy.<br>\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Day-Night Cycle &amp; Home Life</strong> \u2013 Work during the day, then head home to rest and prepare for the next business day.<br>\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Showcase &amp; Sell Products</strong> \u2013 Display your items on shelves and attract customers.<br>\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Customizable Store Design</strong> \u2013 Paint your store\u2019s floors and walls to create your unique space.<br>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Ever-Evolving Gameplay</strong> \u2013 A deep and dynamic system that continues to expand with new features and improvements.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to build the ultimate gaming store? Start your journey in <i>Digital Market Simulator</i> today!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customize Your Store As You Wish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/Store_Customization.gif?t=1745261623\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dynamically Changing Weather</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/Dynamic_Weather.gif?t=1745261623\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Night-Day Cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/extras/Night_Day_Cycle.gif?t=1745261623\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605520?t=1745261623","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/232c91a847811dae5dbc899898b0d9408ad72ef8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745261623","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/2cb1e7a1e4707609eba9f33112cb2eaab74ec072/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745261623","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605520/2cb1e7a1e4707609eba9f33112cb2eaab74ec072/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745261623","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build, Manage, and Grow Your Own Gaming Store!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <i>Digital Market Simulator</i>, where you take charge of your own gaming store, sell video games and gaming-related products, and expand your business! Manage your inventory, design your store, and maximize profits as you create the ultimate shopping experience for gamers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Run Your Own Store</strong> \u2013 Sell video games, consoles, and accessories while managing your stock and pricing strategy.<br>\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Day-Night Cycle &amp; Home Life</strong> \u2013 Work during the day, then head home to rest and prepare for the next business day.<br>\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Showcase &amp; Sell Products</strong> \u2013 Display your items on shelves and attract customers.<br>\ud83d\udd28 <strong>Customizable Store Design</strong> \u2013 Paint your store\u2019s floors and wa